  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n **Stands for**\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nNow, let's check each option,\n\n1) **32 D 5 B 10 A 2 C 62**\n\n→ 32 - 5 × **10 ****÷**** 2** + 62\n\n→ 32 - **5 ****× 5** + 62\n\n→ **32** - 25 **+ 62**\n\n→ 94 - 25 = 69\n\n2) **32 A 5 D 10 B 2 C 62**\n\n→ **32 ****÷**** 5** - 10 × 2 + 62\n\n→ 6.4 - **10 ****×**** 2** + 62\n\n→ **6.4** - 20 + **62**\n\n→ 68.4 - 20 = 48.4\n\n3) **32 B 5 D 10 C 2 A 62**\n\n→ 32 × 5 - 10 + **2 ****÷ 62**\n\n→ **32 ****×**** 5** - 10 + 1/31\n\n→ **160** - 10 + **1/31**\n\n→ 160.03 - 10 = 150.03\n\n4) **32 B 5 D 10 A 2 C 62**\n\n→ 32 × 5 - **10 ****÷**** 2** + 62\n\n→ **32 ****×**** 5** - 5 + 62\n\n→ **160** - 5 **+ 62**\n\n→ 222 - 5 = 217\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"217\"**.",
